13
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:35,220
And it's a [? medal, ?]
actually, in a way.

14
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,460
And it's also kind
of, selfishly, I'm

15
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:43,260
